{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"QueryFilter"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A filter can require component types, exclude them, require components added or changed since","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a tick, and require a relation to a target. Filters read nothing: an entity’s components decide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whether it passes, but a query’s rows carry only the values of its terms.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Build a filter from a static method such as "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/with(_:)-swift.type.method"},{"type":"text","text":" and refine it with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the instance methods of the same names. Each method returns a new filter that an entity passes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only if it meets every condition. To pass entities that meet at least one of several filters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/anyOf(_:)-swift.type.method"},{"type":"text","text":", so you can write any condition on which component types an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity holds:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"